Subject: Admit medium resident Wii file reads without worker handoffs
Upstream-base: ebd80cac99b48a323200d84365e07a58cc27412d

Extend the existing cache-only bound from 64 KiB to 256 KiB. Frontend texture
payloads of 64 KiB or 128 KiB plus their small headers otherwise miss solely
on requested size and can cost another original service frame each.

Keep the same one-group preflight, exact cache key, cursor/EOF semantics,
nonblocking cache locks and allocation/I/O-free copy. Add true maximum-size
byte and cursor oracles, late-sector transactional misses, EOF-tail and
requested-cap-before-clipping cases for both sector layouts and C FFI.

Apply after Nod 0003; paired native DVD bound is in Aurora 0093.

